OL,3,AJaguar Land Rover to cut 4,000 jobs
OL,4,
OL,5,FJaguar Land Rover (JLR) is to cut 4,000
OL,6,Fjobs as the carmaker struggles with
OL,7,FChinese competition, US tariffs, and
OL,8,Fthe transition to electric vehicles.
OL,10,FThe cuts will happen over the next two
OL,11,Fyears and will mostly affect the head
OL,12,Foffice, which is based in the UK.
OL,14,FJLR's long-term issues were made worse
OL,15,Fafter a cyber-attack last year caused
OL,16,Fthe firm, which employs 43,000 people
OL,17,Fglobally, to shut down production for
OL,18,Fmore than a month.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
