OL,3,AJaguar Land Rover to cut 4,000 jobs
OL,4,
OL,5,FChief executive PB Balaji said the firm
OL,6,Fwas "committed to supporting everyone
OL,7,Fwith care, fairness and respect"
OL,8,Fthrough the redundancy process.
